statement:
Let m ∈ ℕ, n := m + 1, ρ > 0, and L := volume on ℝ^n = Eucl n. For every face index F = (z, α) ∈ LatticeFaceIndex n n = ℤ^n × (Fin n ↪o Fin n):
(a) α j = j for all j;
(b) latticeFace ρ F = {x : ρ z_i ≤ x_i ≤ ρ(z_i + 1) for all i};
(c) latticeFace ρ F is measurable;
(d) L(latticeFace ρ F) = ρ^n;
(e) dist(x, y) ≤ √n·ρ for all x, y ∈ latticeFace ρ F.
Moreover:
(f) for L-a.e. x, x_i ≠ ρk for all i ∈ Fin n and all k ∈ ℤ;
(g) ∫⁻ g dL = Σ'_F ∫⁻_{latticeFace ρ F} g dL for every g : ℝ^n → [0, ∞];
(h) ∫ f dL = Σ'_F ∫_{latticeFace ρ F} f dL for every L-integrable f : ℝ^n → ℝ.
